HURRICANE BOT (HRCBOT) - LICENCE
================================

Original work by "Hurricane" (hurricane.bot@gmail.com).
The bot is FREE for everybody. It CANNOT be sold.

You may use the bot in any Source-engine game it can run in.
If you repack the binaries (mod packages, different directory layout, ...),
you must always include all of the original text files (LICENCE.TXT,
README.TXT, LISEZMOI.TXT, IMPORTANT.TXT).  Those are preserved verbatim under
docs/original/.

USAGE IS AT YOUR OWN RISK.

Modernized reconstruction
---------------------------
This tree is a clean-room, syntax-modernized reconstruction of the 2013 binary
(Hurricane Bot 1.3.4) built against Metamod:Source 1.12 and the hl2sdk
hl2dm branch.  It is distributed under the same freeware, non-commercial
terms as the original.  The original source code was never published, so the
behavioural modules (map analysis and pathfinding) are functional reimplementations
derived from the binary's observable interface, not a byte-exact translation.
